<title>USA: PHLX to trade three new options next week.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade three new options next week.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Thursday it would list options on Imperial Bancorp and Regions Financial Corp on March 10.</p>
<p>It also said it would list options on Reliance Group Holdings Inc on March 12.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols and the options' strike prices, exercise months, position limits (in number of contracts) and specialist unit.  </p>
<p>Strikes	  Months	Limits   Specialist</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>22-1/2, 25,    Mar, Apr,   4,500    Mercury Trading</p>
<p>30		 Jun, Sep</p>
<p>55, 60, 65     Mar, Apr,   4,500    Penn Options Co</p>
<p>		   Jul, Oct</p>
<p>10, 12-1/2,    Apr, May,   7,500    Group One Ltd</p>
<p>15		 Jul, Oct</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
